            ]
          },
          "200210302": {
            "id": "200210302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Huh, is that so..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2002104",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Anna",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200211401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200211401": {
            "id": "200211401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Wow, you're really good at this! No wonder Amber said that I could learn a thing or two from you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200211402"
            ]
          },
          "200211402": {
            "id": "200211402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Hehe, with you as my coach, this exam will be a cinch!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200211403"
            ]
          },
          "200211403": {
            "id": "200211403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Thanks so much! Here, these are for you. I'm off to revise some more!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200211404"
            ]
          },
          "200211404": {
            "id": "200211404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "I wonder what color my wind glider should be...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200211405"
            ]
          },
          "200211405": {
            "id": "200211405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Blue? Green? Maybe a bit of both, perhaps?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2002105",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200210501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200210501": {
            "id": "200210501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Second question: what should we take note of when using wind gliders?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2002106",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200210601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200210601": {
            "id": "200210601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "To select appropriate take-off points and to assume the correct take-off posture.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200210602"
            ]
          },
          "200210602": {
            "id": "200210602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Okay, interesting..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2002101",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200210101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200210101": {
            "id": "200210101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Oh, come on, why do we need stuff like a wind glider license?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200210102"
            ]
          },
          "200210102": {
            "id": "200210102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Did you take the license exam, Anthony?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200210103"
            ]
          },
          "200210103": {
            "id": "200210103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Anthony",
            "text": "I don't use wind gliders, so I've never taken the exam...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200210104"
            ]
          },
          "200210104": {
            "id": "200210104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You want to take the gliding exam, Anna?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200210105"
            ]
          },
          "200210105": {
            "id": "200210105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Yup. It's something that all adventurers need to use, so I've been looking to practice!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200210106"
            ]
          },
          "200210106": {
            "id": "200210106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "But I never thought that there was such a thing as a gliding license...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200210107"
            ]
          },
          "200210107": {
            "id": "200210107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "I mean, I've already signed up to take part, but I don't think I have all the knowledge down pat just yet...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200210108"
            ]
          },
          "200210108": {
            "id": "200210108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Traveler, I heard Amber mention that you've got a license already. Could you help me revise for the exam?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200210110",
              "200210114"
            ]
          },
          "200210110": {
            "id": "200210110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Well, no, but I just met her during the signup process.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200210111"
            ]
          },
          "200210111": {
            "id": "200210111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "She mentioned you while explaining the exam process to me. She said you did really well!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200210112"
            ]
          },
          "200210112": {
            "id": "200210112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "So I got to thinking that I could consult you about some of the exam questions...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200210115"
            ]
          },
          "200210115": {
            "id": "200210115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Okay, so, I have three questions for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200210116"
            ]
          },
          "200210116": {
            "id": "200210116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "So... First off, how many people can a single wind glider carry while airborne?"
          },
          "200210114": {
            "id": "200210114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Anna",
            "text": "Great! Thanks a lot, Traveler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
